#. i18n: file: reportwidget.ui:21
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, ReportWidget)
#: rc.cpp:35
msgid ""
"GCOV code coverage statistics.\n"
"\n"
"Set the directory to generate the report for and start the scan. \n"
"\n"
"Once finished, you can select the directories in the coverage report to see "
"their statistics. A more detailed report can be seen for each directory, "
"showing all the covered files in it. Each file can also be shown in the "
"editor, annotated with line by line coverage information."
msgstr ""
"GCOV-Statistik Kodeafdecken\n"
"\n"
"Giff den Orner an, för den Du den Bericht opstellen wullt, un start denn dat "
"Dörkieken.\n"
"\n"
"Is dat afslaten, kannst Du de Ornern binnen den Afdecken-Bericht utsöken un "
"ehr Statistiken ankieken. För elkeen Orner gifft dat en Bericht mit mehr "
"Enkelheiten, de all de Dateien dor binnen wiest. Du kannst de Dateien ok "
"binnen den Editor wiesen, dor staht denn de Afdecken-Informatschonen Reeg "
"för Reeg blang den Inholt."

